    "reason": "[ev-76073e6d10e8] is a one-line PR title saying only that a ManagedResourceActivationPolicy was added. It does not say what kind of thing it is, what it does, or what happens if an operator does nothing. The surrounding section adds little: [ev-de4d43e22a68] says the MRD/MRAP API versions moved to v1alpha1, [ev-1c9c5ba26c97] adds an MRAP reconciler, and [ev-2c984df9c0e9] mentions CRD-to-MRD conversion for packages with the SafeStart capability. None of these gives the API group or the activation behaviour, and none says which environments are exposed or what the consequence is. We need the PR body, the upgrade guide or the MRAP docs to fill in subject, applicability and consequence.",
